WEBVTT

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:16.940
No matter what pretty words
you claim, this is reality.

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:22.030
No matter how noble your cause,
blood will spill if you fight,

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:25.110
and the weak die.

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:26.900
I know.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:30.940
I know that I am only spouting idealism.

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:34.900
So, what are you planning to do?

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.900
Sure, your thoughts are admirable.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:38.900
But I hope you're not asking me

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.980
to risk my life to fight against Berühren,
since you can't move.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:44.280
Juzo!

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:50.070
Justice that doesn't put your own life on
the line is just an empty pipe dream.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:57.360
But...

00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:59.610
Even so...

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:07.360
Even though I know it's a pipe dream...

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:11.650
...I can't help being enamored
by the beauty of it!

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:14.650
I'll put my life on the line!

00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:16.650
To grasp that dream!

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:43.690
This power...

00:01:43.690 --> 00:01:48.780
He used Harmony on himself to remove
the power limitations of his extensions!

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:33.440
Degeneration

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:20.280
You knocked an old man down
without any hesitation.

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:26.940
It seems I have underestimated you.

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:33.230
However, surely you've realized
after experiencing it yourself.

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:37.650
All action causes a reaction.

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:46.400
And the bigger the action,
the bigger the response...

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:54.280
You are only running away
from making the choice.

00:04:54.280 --> 00:05:00.320
By not choosing the right thing,
without fearing the resulting sacrifice...

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:10.280
...you will create a much
larger sacrifice in response.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.280
Sacrifice?

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:15.940
Did you know the young man named Colt?

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:22.320
He worked hard for his family.

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:25.030
He was baited by the rewards
offered by your organization

00:05:25.030 --> 00:05:28.280
and was used as a scapegoat
in your acts of terrorism.

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:37.730
Colt died. Right in front of my eyes.

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:40.860
All the warmth seeped away from his body.

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:49.190
As I thought, you didn't know.

00:05:49.190 --> 00:05:54.650
None of you know anything about the people
who have died because of your actions.

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:05.280
That's why you can talk
about sacrifice so easily.

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:12.610
Aren't you the one who is really running away?

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:16.690
You're turning your eyes away
from the results of your actions.

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:24.570
Why?!

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:27.400
Why don't you finish me off?!

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:34.400
I will surely get my hands on
Harmony and Device 13 someday!

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:44.940
If you want to stop me, this will be
your only chance to finish me off!

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:52.320
It is not my job to pass judgment on you.

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:53.690
And...

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:01.980
...didn't you say that the ideals
of man tend to change?

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:06.440
I do not believe they always
change for the worse.

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:19.230
Such words are mere sophism...

00:07:53.400 --> 00:08:00.530
However, that is yet another form of one
who tries to struggle in this lacking world.

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:06.360
It seems my research was not in vain.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:10.400
I see...

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:43.690
Even though I said such big words and
want to buy as much time as I can for Tetsuro,

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:49.110
I wonder how far I can get with
all these needles shot into me.

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:52.150
Kronen.

00:08:52.150 --> 00:08:57.820
You should take care of your fellow
student before chasing after Extendeds!

00:08:57.820 --> 00:09:01.440
I told you he was an inadequate junior.

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:08.320
Though, as expected of an Over-Extended
that survived that grueling war...

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:10.530
What an overwhelming aura.

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:13.730
Honestly, you're pretty scary.

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:15.280
But, well...

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:21.150
I'm not the one who will be your opponent.

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:28.280
My needles don't only work on Extendeds.

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:33.070
They also aren't only used to limit movement.

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:38.820
I can unleash power that can
even go up against Extendeds.

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:43.780
Though, it causes a lot of strain
on the body in exchange.

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:45.440
Hey, now...

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:52.440
Now that your movements are sealed,
I think there's a good chance of winning.

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:11.030
Y-You! You were a woman?!

00:10:11.030 --> 00:10:14.440
This is the end, profane existence!

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:20.730
Your form is the personification
of the sins of Extendeds.

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:30.190
The man I loved died after being caught
in the crossfire of Extended crime.

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:36.440
I am thankful for this chance
to fight you once again.

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:40.980
Hold on a sec. Some clothes first--

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:54.110
This is really hard to deal with...

00:10:57.150 --> 00:11:00.110
Heated Hand Knife.

00:11:00.110 --> 00:11:02.980
Heavenly Vortex Jigen-ryu.

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:05.230
First Blade!

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:17.940
I don't really like hitting women...

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:24.360
...but I had to bring down that spirit a notch.

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:31.320
You are pretty reckless swallowing
those cigarettes whole.

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:35.940
It seems you were using the medicine
to force your nerves under control,

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:38.610
but now the backlash is setting in.

00:11:40.980 --> 00:11:42.530
It's probably about time.

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:45.780
I'm sure my sponsor is done by now.

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:48.940
Sponsor?

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:50.530
That's right.

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:56.480
I was just buying time for my sponsor
so you wouldn't get in the way.

00:11:56.480 --> 00:12:01.280
I don't actually have much
interest in the two of you.

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:08.940
While there are people here who
purely hate Extendeds like Shimazu,

00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:14.980
most people are in Spitzbergen
for the money now.

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:24.780
Well, I'm sure there are many that hate
Extendeds due to the lack of jobs.

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:27.570
But putting food on the table comes first.

00:12:27.570 --> 00:12:31.400
That old man didn't even understand that.

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:38.400
He only spouts dreams about changing
Extendeds to how they were meant to be.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:40.190
Did you know?

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:42.360
The more terrorism there is,

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:47.190
the more the public accepts extension
technology for self-defense?

00:12:47.190 --> 00:12:51.440
The actions of Spitzbergen,
who wants to stamp out Extendeds,

00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:54.780
increases Berühren's profits.

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:59.900
It can't be that your sponsor...

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:02.280
I think his name was Cunningham?

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:10.230
From now on, I'll be committing acts
of terrorism with money from Berühren.

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:12.860
It's definitely more profitable that way.

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:21.730
That old man was in the way, but he
was always hiding away somewhere.

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:32.940
Well, killing someone who took care of me
for so long is pretty terrible, right?

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:45.480
So... I feel bad for you two,
but today was the perfect chance.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:47.900
You bastard...

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:49.360
Unforgivable.

00:13:52.320 --> 00:14:00.400
You trampled on the ideals
of the elder! Our ideals!

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:03.280
Kunugi!

00:14:12.230 --> 00:14:13.440
You're...!

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:18.070
To be honest, it kinda pisses me off.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:26.070
But that fatty ordered us to
protect this guy, so we have to.

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:29.530
That's work for you.

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:35.820
I'm so sick of it.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:46.070
I have to protect a weak asshole
and kill a sad old man...

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:42.980
Huh?

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:51.110
So, getting to meet you here is really romantic.

00:14:57.690 --> 00:14:59.610
E-Elder!

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:03.820
Oh, wow. That's pretty gory.

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:06.480
You didn't have to bring his head here.

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:17.860
Bastard... what did you do with Tetsuro?

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:25.530
Gun Slave Unit Device 13...

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:30.610
Your hands abandoned you, right?

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:34.940
Elder...

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:42.190
The Gun Slave Unit rebellion
you were ordered to suppress.

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:43.780
Right in the middle of that,

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:48.940
your Hands decided to turn tail from the
enemy and was never heard from again.

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:54.230
Ever since then, you haven't had an owner.

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:55.690
Why?

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:58.980
Are you still being loyal to
the one who abandoned you?

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:03.280
What're you trying to say.

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:06.980
Don't you feel like you're
lacking something, too?

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:15.730
Then, become mine.

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:22.860
So hotblooded.

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:29.320
Hitze Faust.

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:38.400
As I thought, you don't need
an old device like him, Pepper.

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:40.280
I'm more useful than him.

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:44.940
You really don't get it at all.

00:16:48.030 --> 00:16:50.070
Look, Seven.

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:53.110
There's something cool about him
even when he's getting beat up.

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:55.230
Really?

00:16:55.230 --> 00:17:00.280
What are your owners trying to do?

00:17:00.280 --> 00:17:02.530
They even use terrorists...

00:17:02.530 --> 00:17:09.860
You aren't seriously going to tell me
it's just rake in more money, right?

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:11.860
Who knows?

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:18.530
More importantly, it looks like you
still can't get serious about this.

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:22.570
How about I tell you if you can beat Seven?

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:29.650
The place your partner,
who abandoned you, currently is.

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:35.780
I don't know what you're planning.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:38.280
But for a joke...

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:46.070
...that's not funny!

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:53.150
Sturm Faust!

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:04.610
Attack confirmed.

00:18:04.610 --> 00:18:08.690
Following interception procedures,
restricted combat program initiated.

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:12.780
Now you're motivated!

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:16.730
It's smart of you to use the
restricted combat program.

00:18:16.730 --> 00:18:21.190
You'll be able to prevent indiscriminate
targeting, even without a Hands.

00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:24.530
That way, you can fight without any worry.

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:35.030
You know, if I get my hands on you,

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:38.650
I think I'll really be able to confirm
that I'm here in this world.

00:18:41.150 --> 00:18:46.820
That's why I want to take you down
to your knees when you're serious...

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:51.150
...and carve my name into you!

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:55.110
Skeletal lamination compression,
secondary release.

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:04.320
Don't disappoint me too much, Seven.

00:19:26.900 --> 00:19:30.480
He's weak. You don't need him.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.690
It's good to have a second gun on hand.

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:40.320
You should become mine before you get broken.

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:42.940
I can't let that happen.

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:48.730
Funke Faust.

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:52.070
Seven!

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:54.690
Now commencing...

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:56.320
...Battle procedures.

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:22.230
I don't know if you can hear me right now,

00:20:22.230 --> 00:20:26.360
but you can't win against Seven!

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:29.570
Of course not.

00:20:29.570 --> 00:20:32.820
I have a Hands. I have Pepper.

00:20:35.650 --> 00:20:37.650
I'm different from you!

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:45.150
So scary.

00:20:45.150 --> 00:20:50.360
You should never go against an Over-Extended.

00:20:50.360 --> 00:20:54.570
Hey. Don't you think so, too?

00:20:54.570 --> 00:21:01.400
If I leave you behind and Spitzbergen
gets their hand on you,

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:04.860
that would be a pretty big problem.

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:11.900
I just followed those two from Berühren here,
but ran into a nostalgic face.

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:15.570
Long time no see, Kronen.

00:21:15.570 --> 00:21:21.530
We went through the same training
together once, with our hatred for Extendeds...

00:21:21.530 --> 00:21:24.610
But here we are on completely different sides.

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:33.320
Is your car still the only thing in your heart?

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:37.860
My job is to eliminate all criminal Extendeds.

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:41.190
I have nothing to say to a terrorist.

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:49.480
But... Well, you're a different story.

00:21:49.480 --> 00:21:53.650
I have to take responsibility
for an embarrassing fellow pupil.

00:23:27.610 --> 00:23:29.150
What the hell's wrong with you?!

00:23:28.530 --> 00:23:30.480
Was that Inui just now?

00:23:29.150 --> 00:23:30.480
Juzo...

00:23:30.480 --> 00:23:35.440
Well, I guess that's your choice, partner.

00:23:30.480 --> 00:23:35.440
I hate you.

00:23:35.440 --> 00:23:45.440
<i>NO GUNS LIFE</i> . Episode 22.
"Imprisoning Binds."
